<title>POLAND: WARSAW BOURSE CLEARS GPRD FOR BOURSE TRADE.</title>
<headline>WARSAW BOURSE CLEARS GPRD FOR BOURSE TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The supervisory board of the Warsaw bourse approved for trade on the main market of the bourse shares of road builder Gdanskie Przedsiebiorstwo Robot Drogowych SA (GPRD), the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bourse also said it cleared shares in jeans garment maker Elpo SA for trade on the free market, which so far did not have any stocks listed.</p>
<p>It also approved the transfer of Amerbank SA shares from the parallel to the main market of the bourse.</p>
<p>It also cleared new issues of Computerland, Optimus, Kredyt Bank and PPWK for bourse trade.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
